{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11211310","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211310","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121131001:1":{"text":"皆さん、何か分かりましたか？","source_cn":"各位，调查出什么结果了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8B366D8E4D16BA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121131002:0":{"text":"見たところ、聖石町の広場から消えた女神像とまったく同じだな。それに、二体の像にも違いは見られない。","source_cn":"外表看起来和圣石镇广场中心丢失的那座雕像完全一致，两座...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05EFFB162EA5D89F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121131003:2":{"text":"マスターが魔法で何度も確認しました。女神像に残っている魔力は、タレンさんから感じる魔力に似ています……カタストロフの魔力とそっくりです！","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA9C75A1F4B24FE89","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスターが魔法で何度も確認しました。女神像に残っている魔力は、タレンさんから感じる魔力に似ています……カタストロフの魔力とそっくりです！","female":"マスターが魔法で何度も確認しました。女神像に残っている魔力は、タレンさんから感じる魔力に似ています……カタストロフの魔力とそっくりです！","variant_male_record_index":"100979","variant_female_record_index":"100980","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121131004:1":{"text":"ああ、デューラ様！なんたる冒涜！","source_cn":"艾雅在上，这是何等亵渎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9E3A1864768C636","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121131005:1":{"text":"では、目の前にあるこの女神像は、本当に聖石町の物なのですね……？ですが、なぜ二体あるのでしょうか？","source_cn":"那么，矗立在我们面前的，